Man, I just had a wierd game. I'm moseying along my favorite dungeon,
and I'm an 8th level priest with 50 hp and a +7 mace and I figure
that I'm a pretty tough dude. 

What's that I see? An elf? Hmmmm. Looks like time to become sleep
resistent. So I walk on over and bop him on the head.

Then...

The Grey Elf swings his wide sword named Stormbringer. 

The Grey Elf hits !

The black blade steals your life !

Goodbye level 8 !

Oh boy. I was actually scared. I feel sorry for the monsters now that I
know how it must feel to be fighting us mighty hackers.

Also...

Earlier in the same game I had genocided mimics. So I mosey on over
to Possegrone's General store and look over the merchandise.

I see a piece of armour. Noting that mimics were all wiped out, I
figured I would try on some new duds. To my surprise...

Wait !! That's a dog !

WHAT ?!?!?

A piece of armour had transformed into a dog in front of my very eyes !

Oh... what kind of foul magic is this, that has invaded my formerly
blessed Sun 4/280 ?

